  "body": "This PR proposed an `id` attribute in `SerialPortInfo` hoping to address https://github.com/WICG/serial/issues/128.\r\n\r\nThis `id` attribute will only present if there is such an identifier exposed by the system (e.g. combination of pid, vid and serial number, or system identity like [device instance id](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-hardware/drivers/install/device-instance-ids) on Windows).",
